+config SERIAL_BAO1X
+	bool "Baochip bao1x uDMA UART support"
+	depends on HAS_IOMEM
+	depends on OF
+	select SERIAL_CORE
+	help
+	  Serial driver for the PULP-style uDMA UARTs on the Baochip bao1x
+	  SoC. The transmitter is DMA-only and fetches from a dedicated
+	  IFRAM slice used as a bounce buffer; the receiver runs in PIO
